&_nc_oc=AdpS_HsK5xbQwGW4qYzLrpkT9a5aquA-Cl2zU8jNK2hTeeddCNRj5femWX1fo-AnFEo&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQI_p-63TTWgdna07PoCm82RHQRw-yORUfeSM9qJBnNszA&oe=6AA1783E"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-3.png", "id": "1157916768541329", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/57566684_1157916771874662_3154846063092592377_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1bDwwQkwqMcQ7kNvwHU02Pd&_nc_oc=Adrw79Zm-6ZvtDvSUmpakHtrduKHthODKByWti7_VtHQ_WPg5Qd-r8Rhz4AXb9yii1c&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJpm--lNOXAHmOPB2DuqMWs-gzTwGKSMAHzokvFQtrBrg&oe=6AA150FC"}, {"file_name": "Flipside-Meta_Screenshot-4.png", "id": "503354952327839", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/473394163_503354955661172_3675385292904393650_n.png?_nc_cat=111&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=-p14Bbeg4sUQ7kNvwGE2cAz&_nc_oc=Adr1iA8HSl_dLTC2NOs2WDFWlkhSZpB3LG2BWpkjBYTAY4nsKRampWezR7W_0VIKISM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK984c0scIZQ3lgD8YhJxYOjF-iJfYo0i5hrMy5rOXUMg&oe=6AA16F87"}, {"file_name": "FS_Screenshot-5.png", "id": "377927191539358", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39035465_377927194872691_2692247835418631299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=s353d_Yx_CAQ7kNvwFtZBTx&_nc_oc=AdpIdvnYr-oKSuSGmCk-2aDl02olXw-MXegi3gsl94m14Qj5G-ZEKTHXRiVPu-L441Q&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-3.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJXLL4am9wk8MB-AoY6_oMdoUvwCUPHVL5fF0Ht3rf89g&oe=6AA15B55"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "FS_Cover-Landscape.png", "id": "948055656716612", "uri": "https://scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/39001731_948055660049945_3697445677810051434_n.png?_nc_cat=107&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=OrIzh-k0bj0Q7kNvwFTShMY&_nc_oc=AdqTFX2E3jgVIsvGYbZYq_7mfriZyy9IG-D1pW27mbU5pK9v8kdsCYU5Kh9A6oiF8Ao&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-lga3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLMFslYpnFM76vyHsXKm4zW61I58JCkspkAABCr8DC16A&oe=6AA167E4"}, "display_name": "Flipside", "keywords": ["animation", "mocap", "recording", "metaverse", "social"], "long_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.\n\n# Highlights:\n\n- Browse, watch, like, share and subscribe to other Flipside creators\n- Remix other creators' posts, where you can replace characters with yourself\n- Send direct messages to connect with your friends and share content\n- Record full 3D spatial recordings, including motion capture, voice, props, music and more\n- An ever-growing catalog of built-in characters, props and sets\n- Generate custom characters with built-in Ready Player Me integration\n- Generate teleprompter scripts and custom sets using AI tools\n- Show tools including cameras, camera switcher, teleprompters, slideshow, and more\n- Audio controller to add music and special effects, including a built-in audio library or import your own\n- Use our companion Flipside Broadcaster app for PC to capture 2D content for other social platforms\n- Use our Flipside Creator Tools plugin for Unity to import your own custom characters, props, and sets\n- And too many features to list them all\n\nDownload Flipside today!", "short_description": "Flipside is the metaverse social media platform for next-gen creators and their fans.\n\nWatch a steady stream of spatial content, which you can like, subscribe, share, and even remix. Connect with friends over multiplayer and watch together!\n\nNext-gen creators make spatial recordings using Flipside\u2019s built-in virtual TV studio, then share them to your channel and build a fanbase of subscribers.